---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
const seo = {
  pageName: 'Privacy',
  title: 'Privacy policy | Willowbrook Animal Rescue',
  description: 'What Willowbrook Animal Rescue collects, why, how long we keep it, and how to ask us to delete it.',
};

---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Plainly: we collect only what we need to rehome animals and run the
        shop, we do not sell anything to anybody, and you can ask us to delete
        your data at any time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap policy prose">
    <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
    <h3>Adoption applications</h3>
    <p>
      Your name, contact details, address, and your answers about your home and
      your experience with animals. We need this to assess whether a particular
      animal will do well with you — it is the entire basis of the decision.
      Applications are readable only by shelter staff.
    </p>

    <h3>Newsletter</h3>
    <p>
      Your email address, and your first name if you give it. Used only to send
      the monthly email. Every one carries an unsubscribe link, and we act on it
      the same day.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact form</h3>
    <p>
      Your name, email, and message. Used to reply to you and nothing else.
    </p>

    <h3>Shop orders</h3>
    <p>
      Orders and payments are handled by Wix, which processes your delivery and
      payment details on our behalf. We never see your card number.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Successful applications:</strong> for the life of the animal, so we can help if something changes.</li>
      <li><strong>Unsuccessful applications:</strong> two years, in case you apply again.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> until you unsubscribe.</li>
      <li><strong>Enquiries:</strong> twelve months.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>
      Nobody, other than the service providers we need to run the site — Wix
      hosts it and processes shop orders. We do not sell or trade personal data,
      and we never share application details with other shelters without asking
      you first.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      We use only what makes the site work: a session cookie that remembers
      your shopping basket. There is no advertising or analytics tracking. The
      map on our contact page is served by OpenStreetMap, which does not set
      advertising cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK GDPR you can ask to see the data we hold about you, correct it,
      have it deleted, or object to how we use it. Email
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will respond
      within a month. If you are unhappy with our response you can complain to
      the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name}, {SITE.address.line1}, {SITE.address.locality},
      {' '}{SITE.address.postcode}.<br />
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> ·
      <a href={`tel:${SITE.phoneHref}`}>{SITE.phone}</a>
    </p>

    <p class="policy-note muted">
      This is placeholder wording for a demonstration site. Before going live,
      have it reviewed against your actual data-handling practices and
      registration with the ICO.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-block: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2.5vw, 3.5rem) 1rem; }
  .policy { padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 720px; }
  .policy h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .policy h3 { font-size: var(--step-0); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .policy-note {
    margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
</style>
